sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant APIServer as API Server<br/>8000/TCP
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant Redis as Redis / Valkey
    participant Processor as Processor<br/>(StatefulSet)
    participant InfGW as llm-d Inference<br/>Gateway
    participant GC as Garbage Collector
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,Redis: Flow 1: Batch Job Submission
        Client->>APIServer: POST /v1/files<br/>Upload JSONL input file
        APIServer->>S3: Store input file<br/>AWS SDK credentials
        S3-->>APIServer: File stored
        APIServer->>PG: Insert file metadata<br/>Connection string auth
        PG-->>APIServer: File ID
        APIServer-->>Client: File object (OpenAI format)

        Client->>APIServer: POST /v1/batches<br/>X-MaaS-Username: tenant
        APIServer->>PG: Create batch record<br/>with tenant ID
        PG-->>APIServer: Batch ID
        APIServer->>Redis: Enqueue to priority queue
        Redis-->>APIServer: Queued
        APIServer-->>Client: Batch object (status: validating)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Processor,S3: Flow 2: Batch Job Processing
        Processor->>Redis: Poll priority queue<br/>(every 5s)
        Redis-->>Processor: Next batch job
        Processor->>S3: Download input file
        S3-->>Processor: JSONL data

        loop For each request in batch (AIMD concurrency)
            Processor->>InfGW: POST inference request<br/>Optional TLS / mTLS
            alt Success (2xx)
                InfGW-->>Processor: Inference result
                Note over Processor: AIMD: additive increase +1
            else Rate limited (429) or Error (5xx)
                InfGW-->>Processor: Error response
                Note over Processor: AIMD: multiplicative decrease ×0.5
                Processor->>InfGW: Retry with backoff
                InfGW-->>Processor: Inference result
            end
        end

        Processor->>S3: Write output file
        Processor->>PG: Update batch status → completed
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over GC,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Garbage Collection
        GC->>PG: Query expired batches/files<br/>(every 30m)
        PG-->>GC: Expired records
        GC->>S3: Delete expired files
        GC->>PG: Remove expired records

        Note over GC,K8sAPI: Reconciler (every 60m)
        GC->>K8sAPI: Watch processor pods<br/>ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>GC: Pod status list
        GC->>PG: Requeue orphaned jobs<br/>(dead processor pods)
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 245)
        Note over Client,APIServer: Flow 4: Status Check
        Client->>APIServer: GET /v1/batches/{batch_id}
        APIServer->>PG: Query batch status
        PG-->>APIServer: Batch record
        APIServer-->>Client: Batch object with progress
    end
